03:01:26.801 --> 03:01:28.161
<v Clips>Er ist nicht dieser Art Mann.

03:01:30.557 --> 03:01:36.057
<v Clips>Be sure. To give somebody what he would like to get. That for a self-made man

03:01:36.057 --> 03:01:38.137
